  "content": "<p>當我在其他模組中找不到我想要的功能時，我就自己製作模組！我能找到的所有按鍵顯示模組僅支援 WASD 和滑鼠按鈕，但我需要更多的移動按鈕，因此這裡就是它了！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@kiluhoMC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-FF0000?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fkiluhoMC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitter-000000?style=for-the-badge&logo=x\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/kiluho/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-24292e?style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkiluho\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support_me_on_Ko--fi-202020?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=FF6433\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b0d14c0d07bad40ca976106c84b4744646cd697c.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>💾 下載</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available_for-Fabric-decfc3?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Fabric\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available_for-Quilt-8B2DF6?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Quilt\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available_for-1.21.x-79C05A?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Version\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1471813?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge Downloads\"></p>\n<p>kiluho 的按鍵顯示模組支援 <strong>1.21</strong> 及以上版本。此模組需要以下前置模組：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>（用於設定介面）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkiluhos-keystrokes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#1bd96a\">↗ Modrinth</span></strong></a> 檢視此模組</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>💡 回饋</h2>\n<p>我非常感謝關於此模組的任何回饋或建議！</p>\n<p>您可以透過 <strong>建議表單</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/kiluho/kiluhos-Keystrokes/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此處</a> 提交想法。如果您有任何回饋或想討論此模組，歡迎 [在 Twitter 上 @ 我](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fintent%252ftweet%253ftext%253dHey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/intent/tweet?text=Hey</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/kiluhoMC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@kiluhoMC</a> &amp;related=kiluhoMC) 或使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/kiluho/kiluhos-Keystrokes/discussions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 討論區</a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\\_✦ 由 AI 協助 - 模型：Gemini 3.1 Pro\\_</p>",
